Package: weatherunion
Version: 0.1.0
Title: Access Weather Data from the 'Weather Union' API
Description: Fetches current temperature, humidity, wind, rainfall and air
    quality readings from the 'Weather Union' API
    <https://www.weatherunion.com/>, which requires an API key. Includes a
    catalog of supported localities in India.
